WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.355
Ricky: Brenda lives so far away.

2
00:00:14.356 --> 00:00:21.034
Brian: I’m already getting tired, Ricky.

3
00:00:21.035 --> 00:00:27.480
Driver: Okay, boys, you need to change buses here.

4
00:00:27.481 --> 00:00:32.877
Ricky: Thank you.

5
00:00:32.878 --> 00:00:35.955
Driver: Do you know which bus to take?

6
00:00:35.956 --> 00:00:45.194
Ricky: Yes. No problem.

7
00:00:45.195 --> 00:00:48.120
Brian: Which bus are we taking now?

8
00:00:48.121 --> 00:00:55.692
Ricky: The one to New . . . New . . .

9
00:00:55.693 --> 00:01:01.058
Here. For New Mont. This is our bus.

10
00:01:01.059 --> 00:01:03.970
Brian: Are you sure, Ricky?

11
00:01:03.971 --> 00:01:10.001
Ricky: Of course, I’m sure.

12
00:01:10.002 --> 00:01:17.512
Driver: This is the bus for New Mont.

13
00:01:17.513 --> 00:01:22.026
Brian: Uh, Ricky, something’s not right.

14
00:01:22.027 --> 00:01:25.101
Ricky: You worry too much, Brian.

15
00:01:25.102 --> 00:01:31.092
Brian: We need the bus for Newman, not New Mont.

16
00:01:31.093 --> 00:01:39.822
Ricky & Brian: Oh no! We’re on the wrong bus!

